msgid "构建安全声明"
msgstr "Build Security Notice"

msgid "Triton-Ascend支持源码编译安装，在编译时会下载依赖第三方库并执行构建shell脚本，在编译过程中会产生临时程序文件和编译目录。用户可根据需要自行对源代码目录内的文件进行权限管控降低安全风险。"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend supports source code compilation and installation. During compilation, it downloads dependent third-party libraries and executes build shell scripts, generating temporary program files and compilation directories. Users can manage permissions for files in the source code directory as needed to reduce security risks."

